abstract: >-
  Analysis code for a two-sample Mendelian randomization study that uses OneK1K
  single-cell cis-eQTL data (980 donors, 14 immune cell types) as the exposure and
  female infertility GWAS (GCST90483463) as the outcome, integrating colocalization,
  conditional analysis, fine-mapping, cis-SMR/HEIDI and a phenome-wide scan
  (FinnGen R12). The pipeline comprises 148 scripts (136 Python, 12 R).
